      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f2dea8d22470972dc58e995|full_name}: VRChat makes ripping trivially easy by writing the avatar/world files directly to disk without any kind of protection. All the ripper needs to do is copy the files from cache and use an Unity extractor.\n\nNo need for modded VRChat client. No need to steal the encryption keys. Just a simply copy&paste the file...\n\nI understand that security measures might be eventually be broken. But that's no excuse have zero security measures at all.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
