      "value": "@{62deee45a721d644ba047599|full_name}: no, thats exacly the reason to not bother, because what will you gain? 1? maybe 7 days of protection if you are lucky? and then the guide on some random discord will just change the wording from \"copy files from this folder\" to \"drag and drop the files from this folder to this app\" changing nothing... Well not nothing, all the normal users will pay for it, with longer avatar loading times.\n\nThats why this canny is actually good, as it wants something actually usefull to stop and ban these people, just easier way to report and track it - as vrchat is really lacking here, some people don't even extract the avatars, they just reupload them as they are. So thats something to fix and make it easier to report it.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
